  "description": "A lightweight, zero-dependency, pure C# library for generating PDF 1.7 documents\n       with a fluent, composable API. Features include rich text styling (bold, italic,\n       underline, strikethrough, custom line-height), multi-span mixed formatting,\n       Column / Row / Table layouts, PNG and JPEG image embedding, rounded and per-edge\n       borders, explicit page breaks, clickable hyperlink annotations, headers, footers,\n       page numbers, and a full Material Design colour palette — with no native binaries\n       and no third-party runtime dependencies.",
